		"description": "A Soane plinth field with three grid2d substrates running the same array under three different cartridges: disco (fast rhythm), slow (same rule, slower tempo), random (no memory, full entropy). The plaza IS the array; the cartridges are the lesson. Walk south to north past disco, slow, random — feel the array's sameness and the cartridge's difference.",
